{"id": "8th-u7-q859", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poets-titles-identity-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆசிரியர்களையும் அவர்களின் மாற்றுப் பெயர்கள் / சிறப்புப் பட்டங்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) திருமூலர் - 1. சுல்தான் அப்துல்காதர்\nஆ) குணங்குடி மஸ்தான் சாகிபு - 2. பதினெண் சித்தர்களுள் மற்றும் நாயன்மார்களுள் ஒருவர்\nஇ) திரிகூடராசப்பக் கவிராயர் - 3. திருக்குற்றாலநாதர் கோவில் வித்துவான்\nஈ) எம்.ஜி. இராமச்சந்திரன் - 4. பாரத ரத்னா & புரட்சி நடிகர்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-3, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "திருமூலர்: நாயன்மார் & சித்தர் (2), குணங்குடி மஸ்தான் சாகிபு: சுல்தான் அப்துல்காதர் (1), திரிகூடராசப்பக் கவிராயர்: குற்றாலநாதர் கோவில் வித்துவான் (3), எம்.ஜி.ஆர்: பாரத ரத்னா (4). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 1, 3, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical authors / personalities with their titles / real names:\na) Thirumoolar - 1. Sultan Abdul Khader\nb) Gunangudi Masthan Sahibu - 2. Revered Nayanmar and classical Siddhar\nc) Thirikooda Rasappa Kavirayar - 3. Thirukutralanathar Kovil Vidhwan\nd) M.G. Ramachandran - 4. Bharat Ratna & Puratchi Nadigar"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-2, b-1, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Thirumoolar: Nayanmar & Siddhar (2), Masthan Sahibu: Sultan Abdul Khader (1), Rasappa Kavirayar: Kovil Vidhwan (3), M.G.R: Bharat Ratna (4). Sequence: 2, 1, 3, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-7", "matching", "personalities", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u7-q860", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kanni-poetic-devices-metrics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கள்ளக் கருத்துகளைக் கட்டோடு அறுத்தவருக்கு உள்ளிருக்கும் மெய்ஞ்ஞான ஒளியே பராபரமே!\" - இவ்வடிகளில் அமைந்துள்ள தொடை நயங்களை ஆராய்க:\n1. 'கள்ள', 'உள்ளிருக்கும்' என்பன இரண்டாம் எழுத்து ஒன்றிவரும் எதுகை நயமாகும்.\n2. 'கள்ள', 'கருத்துகளை', 'கட்டோடு' என்பன முதல் எழுத்து ஒன்றிவரும் மோனை நயமாகும்.\n3. 'விரும்பி', 'விரும்பாது' என்பன முரண் தொடை நயமாகும்.\n4. 'அறுத்தவருக்கு' என்பதில் நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு (கு) இணைந்துள்ளது."}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "1, 2, 4 மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "1, 2, 3, 4 அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 135 மதிப்பீடு: எதுகை (கள்ள - உள்ளிருக்கும்), மோனை (கள்ள - கருத்துகளை - கட்டோடு), முரண் (விரும்பி - விரும்பாது), 'அறுத்தவருக்கு' (கு - நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு). அனைத்து இலக்கணக் கூறுகளும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the poetic devices (Thodai Nayam) and grammatical facets in the verse 'Kallak karutthugalaik kattodu arutthavarukku...':\n1. 'Kalla' and 'Ullirukkum' exhibit Ethugai (second-letter rhyming concordance).\n2. 'Kalla', 'Karutthugalai', and 'Kattodu' exhibit Monai (first-letter alliteration).\n3. 'Virumbi' and 'Virumbaathu' present Muran (antithetical semantic contrast).\n4. 'Arutthavarukku' bears the fourth case suffix 'ku'."}], "options": {"A": "Only 1, 2 are correct", "B": "Only 2, 3 are correct", "C": "Only 1, 2, 4 are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, 3, 4 are correct"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 135: The verse contains Ethugai (ll-ll), Monai (k-k-k), Muran (desiring vs not desiring), and 4th case suffix 'ku'. All 4 statements are completely accurate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 134, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-7", "grammar", "poetics", "metrics", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u7-q861", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirumanthiram-meter-identification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"படமாடக் கோயில் பகவற்கு ஒன்று ஈயில் நடமாடக் கோயில் நம்பர்க்கு அங்கு ஆகா\" - திருமூலரின் இப்பாடலடிகளில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள யாப்பிலக்கண அடி வகை யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "அளவடி (நான்கு சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அடிகளால் அமைந்தது)", "B": "குறளடி (இரண்டு சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அடிகள்)", "C": "சிந்தடி (மூன்று சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அடிகள்)", "D": "நெடிலடி (ஐந்து சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அடிகள்)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 133: \"படமாடக் கோயில் பகவற்கு ஒன்றுஈயில்\" (4 சீர்கள்), \"நடமாடக் கோயில் நம்பர்க்குஅங்கு ஆகா\" (4 சீர்கள்) என அனைத்து அடிகளும் நான்கு சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அளவடிகளால் ஆனவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the metric line structure (Adi Vagai) utilized in Thirumoolar's verse 'Padamaadak koyil bagavarku ondru eeyil...':"}], "options": {"A": "Alavadi (Lines composed of exactly four metric feet)", "B": "Kuraladi (Lines composed of two metric feet)", "C": "Cinthadi (Lines composed of three metric feet)", "D": "Nediladi (Lines composed of five metric feet)"}, "explanation": "Each poetic line in Thirumoolar's hymn consists of exactly four metric feet (seers), structurally classified as Alavadi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-7", "grammar", "prosody", "metrics", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u7-q862", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u6-naadu", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sandhi-punarchi-rules", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஆனந்தவெள்ளம்', 'உள்ளிருக்கும்' ஆகிய சொற்களின் புணர்ச்சி விதிகள் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. 'ஆனந்தவெள்ளம்' (ஆனந்தம் + வெள்ளம்): 'மவ்வீறு ஒற்றழிந்து உயிரீறு ஒப்பவும்' என்னும் விதிப்படி நிலைமொழி மகர மெய் மறைந்து புணர்ந்தது.\n2. 'உள்ளிருக்கும்' (உள் + இருக்கும்): 'தனிக்குறில்முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்' மற்றும் 'உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே' என்னும் விதிகளின்படி புணர்ந்தது."}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று 1 மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "கூற்றுகள் 1, 2 இரண்டும் சரி", "C": "கூற்று 2 மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "கூற்றுகள் இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 135 மதிப்பீடு: ஆனந்தம் + வெள்ளம் = ஆனந்தவெள்ளம் (மகர ஈறு அழிதல்); உள் + இருக்கும் = உள் + ள் + இருக்கும் = உள்ளிருக்கும் (தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று இரட்டல் + உடல்மேல் உயிர் ஒன்றல்). இரண்டு புணர்ச்சி விதிகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the grammatical Sandhi (Punarchi) rules operating in 'Aanandhavellam' and 'Ullirukkum':\n1. 'Aanandham + vellam = Aanandhavellam': The standing word final 'm' elided under the rule of terminal makara elision.\n2. 'Ul + irukkum = Ullirukkum': The consonant after a mono-short vowel doubled before an incoming vowel, followed by consonant-vowel merger."}], "options": {"A": "Only Statement 1 is correct", "B": "Both Statements 1 and 2 are correct", "C": "Only Statement 2 is correct", "D": "Both Statements are incorrect"}, "explanation": "Both Sandhi rules are classical Tamil grammatical truths explaining the formation of Aanandhavellam (loss of terminal m) and Ullirukkum (gemination of lateral consonant after short vowel)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-7", "grammar", "punarchi", "sandhi", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u7-q863", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "naman-noun-morphology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒன்றே குலமும் ஒருவனே தேவனும் நன்றே நினைமின் நமனில்லை நாணாமே\" - இப்பாடலடியில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள 'நமன்' என்னும் சொல்லின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "வினைத்தொகை", "B": "பண்புத்தொகை", "C": "பெயர்ச்சொல் (எமனைக் குறிக்கும் காரணப் பெயர்ச்சொல்)", "D": "ஏவல் வினைமுற்று"}, "explanation": "'நமன்' என்பது உயிர்களைக் கவரும் எமனைக் குறிக்கும் பெயர்ச்சொல் ஆகும்; 'நமனுக்கு அஞ்சோம்' என்பதில் அஃது எழுவாயாக நின்று பொருள் தருகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification of the word 'Naman' in 'Nandre ninaimin namanillai naanaamae'?"}], "options": {"A": "Vinaitthogai (Verbal compound)", "B": "Panbutthogai (Qualitative compound)", "C": "Peyarchol (Noun denoting Yama / God of Death)", "D": "Eeval Vinaimutru (Imperative finite verb)"}, "explanation": "'Naman' is a classical noun denoting Yama, the lord of death, functioning as the subject of the clause."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-7", "grammar", "morphology", "parts-of-speech", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u7-q864", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "masthan-mountains-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குணங்குடி மஸ்தான் சாகிபு தவம் இயற்றி ஞானம் பெற்ற மலைப்பகுதிகளுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "சதுரகிரி", "B": "புறாமலை", "C": "நாகமலை", "D": "கொல்லிமலை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 135 நூல் வெளி: குணங்குடி மஸ்தான் சாகிபு சதுரகிரி, புறாமலை, நாகமலை முதலிய மலைப் பகுதிகளில் தவம் இயற்றினார். கொல்லிமலை என்பது நாமகலில் உள்ள சங்ககால மலை; மஸ்தான் சாகிபுவின் தவ மலையல்ல. எனவே பொருந்தாதது 'கொல்லிமலை'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the mountain that was NOT a meditation retreat of Gunangudi Masthan Sahibu:"}], "options": {"A": "Sathuragiri", "B": "Puramalai", "C": "Nagamalai", "D": "Kollimalai"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 135: Masthan Sahibu meditated at Sathuragiri, Puramalai, and Nagamalai. Kollimalai is not among his retreats. Hence Kollimalai is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edi