{"id": "8th-u7-q892", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u7-aram", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ayothidhasar-languages-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அயோத்திதாசர் ஆழ்ந்த புலமை பெற்றிருந்த மொழிகளின் பட்டியலில் பொருந்தாத மொழியைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "தமிழ்", "B": "பாலி", "C": "வடமொழி", "D": "கிரேக்கம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 136: அயோத்திதாசர் தமிழ், பாலி, வடமொழி, ஆங்கிலம் ஆகிய நான்கு மொழிகளிலேயே ஆழ்ந்த புலமை பெற்றிருந்தார். கிரேக்க மொழியில் அவர் புலமை பெற்றதாகப் பாடநூலில் இல்லை. எனவே பொருந்தாதது 'கிரேக்கம்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the language that does NOT belong to the multilingual mastery of Ayothidhasar:"}], "options": {"A": "Tamil", "B": "Pali", "C": "Sanskrit (Vadamozhi)", "D": "Greek (Kiraekkam)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 136: Ayothidhasar was accomplished in Tamil, Pali, Sanskrit, and English. Greek is not among them. Hence Greek is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chap