{"id": "8th-u7-q978", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u4-kalai", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalaisorkkal-odd-pair", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலைச்சொற்கள் இணையில் தவறாகப் பொருத்தப்பட்டுள்ள பொருந்தாத இணையைக் கண்டறிக:\nஅ) Scholar - அறிஞர்\nஆ) Charity - சீர்திருத்தம்\nஇ) Integrity - நேர்மை\nஈ) Philosophy - தத்துவம்"}], "options": {"A": "Scholar - அறிஞர்", "B": "Charity - சீர்திருத்தம் (தவறான பொருத்தம்; Charity என்றால் தொண்டு, Reform என்றால் சீர்திருத்தம்)", "C": "Integrity - நேர்மை", "D": "Philosophy - தத்துவம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 151: Charity என்பதன் சரியான தமிழாக்கம் 'தொண்டு' ஆகும். 'சீர்திருத்தம்' என்பது Reform என்பதன் தமிழாக்கமாகும். எனவே (ஆ) தவறான இணை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the incorrectly matched vocabulary pair (Odd one out):\na) Scholar - Arignar\nb) Charity - Seerthiruttham\nc) Integrity - Naermai\nd) Philosophy - Thathuvam"}], "options": {"A": "Scholar - Arignar", "B": "Charity - Seerthiruttham (Incorrect; Charity = Thondu, Reform = Seerthiruttham)", "C": "Integrity - Naermai", "D": "Philosophy - Thathuvam"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 151: Charity translates to 'Thondu'. 'Seerthiruttham' corresponds to Reform. Therefore (b) is the erroneous match."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "al