{"id": "8th-u7-q980", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u8-manitham", "lesson_id": "8th-u7-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "navilthorum-noolnayam-ani-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நவில்தொறும் நூல்நயம் போலும் பயில்தொறும் பண்புடையாளர் தொடர்பு' - இக்குறளில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அணி யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "பிறிதுமொழிதல் அணி", "B": "தற்குறிப்பேற்ற அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 152: இக்குறளில் 'போலும்' என்ற உவம உருபு வெளிப்படையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'உவமையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'Navilthorum noolnayam poolum payilthorum panpudaiyaalar thodarpu' - What poetic figure of speech is present in this kural?"}], "options": {"A": "Pirithumozhithal Ani", "B": "Tharkurippaetra Ani", "C": "Vetrrumai Ani", "D": "Uvamaiyanni (Simile)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 152: In this verse, the simile particle 'poolum' is overtly stated, making it a classic 'Uvamaiyanni'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 152, "chapter": null, "se